---
/**
 * ChainBoundaries.astro
 *
 * 副校长回复链路重构那篇博文第二节的图：一条群消息从进来到被记住要经过的五段，
 * 以及这次重构收敛出的四条边界（A 输入规范化、B 轮次权限、C 执行与结果、D 呈现 / 投递 / 提交）。
 * 左侧标出重构前「同一条规则有几份副本」落在哪一段。
 *
 * 静态 SVG，没有 JS，没有动效。样式只用站点语义 token，明暗主题自动跟随。
 * 字号写在样式里：手机上整张图被缩小，需要把字放大回来。
 */
---

<figure class='cb-fig not-prose'>
  <figcaption class='cb-cap'>
    <strong>图 1 · 一条群消息要经过的五段，和这次收敛出的四条边界。</strong>左边是重构前同一条规则被写了几份、各落在哪一段；右边是重构后每条规则唯一的家。
  </figcaption>

  <div class='cb-scroll'>
  <svg
    class='cb-svg'
    viewBox='0 0 720 400'
    role='img'
    aria-label='示意图：从上到下五段——接收、受理、处理、投递、提交。左侧标注重构前的多副本：留存规则三份分布在处理与提交、消息段分类三份分布在接收与处理、队列两套分布在受理。右侧用四个括号标出边界 A 输入规范化覆盖接收与受理、B 轮次权限覆盖受理、C 执行与结果覆盖处理、D 呈现投递提交覆盖投递与提交。'
  >
    <!-- 中间五段 -->
    <g class='cb-stage'>
      <rect x='270' y='18' width='180' height='52' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='360' y='39' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-md cb-bold'>接收</text>
      <text x='360' y='58' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-sm cb-muted'>QQ 平台事件 · 形状校验</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cb-stage'>
      <rect x='270' y='92' width='180' height='52' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='360' y='113' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-md cb-bold'>受理</text>
      <text x='360' y='132' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-sm cb-muted'>占用消息 ID · 租约 · 排队</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cb-stage'>
      <rect x='270' y='166' width='180' height='52' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='360' y='187' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-md cb-bold'>处理</text>
      <text x='360' y='206' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-sm cb-muted'>引用 · 上下文 · 主模型 / 备用</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cb-stage'>
      <rect x='270' y='240' width='180' height='52' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='360' y='261' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-md cb-bold'>投递</text>
      <text x='360' y='280' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-sm cb-muted'>分段发送 · 每段一个 ACK</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cb-stage'>
      <rect x='270' y='314' width='180' height='52' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='360' y='335' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-md cb-bold'>提交</text>
      <text x='360' y='354' text-anchor='middle' class='cb-fs-sm cb-muted'>会话日志 · 问答记忆 · 缓存</text>
    </g>

    <!-- 段与段之间的箭头 -->
    <g class='cb-arrow'>
      <path d='M360,70 L360,86'></path>
      <path d='M360,144 L360,160'></path>
      <path d='M360,218 L360,234'></path>
      <path d='M360,292 L360,308'></path>
      <path d='M356,82 L360,88 L364,82'></path>
      <path d='M356,156 L360,162 L364,156'></path>
      <path d='M356,230 L360,236 L364,230'></path>
      <path d='M356,304 L360,310 L364,304'></path>
    </g>

    <!-- 左侧：重构前的副本，每一行对准它主要落在的那一段 -->
    <text x='16' y='12' class='cb-fs-sm cb-muted'>重构前：同一条规则的副本</text>
    <g class='cb-copy'>
      <path d='M250,44 L266,44'></path>
      <text x='16' y='40' class='cb-fs-sm'>
        <tspan x='16' dy='0' class='cb-bold'>消息段分类 × 3</tspan>
        <tspan x='16' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>引用展开 / 直接消息 / 备用判定</tspan>
      </text>
    </g>
    <g class='cb-copy'>
      <path d='M250,118 L266,118'></path>
      <text x='16' y='114' class='cb-fs-sm'>
        <tspan x='16' dy='0' class='cb-bold'>队列 × 2</tspan>
        <tspan x='16' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>写死的两个群 / 其余走旧链</tspan>
      </text>
    </g>
    <g class='cb-copy'>
      <path d='M250,192 L266,192'></path>
      <text x='16' y='188' class='cb-fs-sm'>
        <tspan x='16' dy='0' class='cb-bold'>上下文拼装 × 2</tspan>
        <tspan x='16' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>主群按位置 / 保护队列按 ID</tspan>
      </text>
    </g>
    <g class='cb-copy'>
      <path d='M250,340 L266,340'></path>
      <text x='16' y='336' class='cb-fs-sm'>
        <tspan x='16' dy='0' class='cb-bold'>留存规则 × 3</tspan>
        <tspan x='16' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>实时写入 / 启动迁移 / 缓存恢复</tspan>
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- 右侧：四条边界 -->
    <text x='704' y='12' text-anchor='end' class='cb-fs-sm cb-muted'>重构后：每条规则唯一的家</text>
    <g class='cb-bound'>
      <path d='M468,22 L484,22 L484,86 L468,86'></path>
      <text x='496' y='44' class='cb-fs-sm'>
        <tspan x='496' dy='0' class='cb-bold cb-accent'>A · 输入规范化</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>一次分类，主备同一视图</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>控制命令一张表</tspan>
      </text>
    </g>
    <g class='cb-bound'>
      <path d='M468,96 L484,96 L484,214 L468,214'></path>
      <text x='496' y='150' class='cb-fs-sm'>
        <tspan x='496' dy='0' class='cb-bold cb-accent'>B · 轮次权限</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>队列策略读配置</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>四个命名检查代替九处手拼</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.6em' class='cb-bold cb-accent'>C · 执行与结果</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>提交前明确本轮结果类别</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>工具副作用按对象身份声明</tspan>
      </text>
    </g>
    <g class='cb-bound'>
      <path d='M468,244 L484,244 L484,362 L468,362'></path>
      <text x='496' y='290' class='cb-fs-sm'>
        <tspan x='496' dy='0' class='cb-bold cb-accent'>D · 投递与提交</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>bot 行与问答统一提交</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>retainPolicy 唯一规则</tspan>
        <tspan x='496' dy='1.35em' class='cb-muted'>恢复只写记录，从不发送</tspan>
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  </div>

  <p class='cb-note'>示意图。段的划分按源码里的实际模块，边界 A–D 的命名沿用评审报告。</p>
</figure>

<style>
  .cb-fig {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .cb-cap {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .cb-cap strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .cb-note {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .cb-svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 680px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cb-svg text {
    font-family: inherit;
    fill: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .cb-svg .cb-muted {
    fill: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .cb-svg .cb-accent {
    fill: hsl(var(--primary));
  }

  .cb-svg .cb-bold {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cb-fs-sm {
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .cb-fs-md {
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .cb-stage rect {
    fill: hsl(var(--card));
    stroke: hsl(var(--border));
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .cb-arrow path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .cb-copy path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }

  .cb-copy .cb-copy-thin {
    stroke-dasharray: 2 4;
  }

  .cb-bound path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: hsl(var(--primary));
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  /* 手机上不放大字号（会互相重叠），改为让图在自己的容器里横向滚动，页面本身不出现横向滚动 */
  .cb-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cb-svg {
      min-width: 620px;
    }
  }
</style>
